{
    "id": "88",
    "code": "88",
    "title": " 88   Gracias Kachun",
    "musicalNote": " (Sol Mayor)",
    "chorus": [],
    "paragraphs": [
        {
            "id": "897",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /Gracias kachun Dios Tataman \n Jesús Salvadormanta/ \n Pay jamorqa kay pachaman\n Runasta salvanampaj."
        },
        {
            "id": "898",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /Aleluya, Aleluya. \n Kusikuna Jesuspi/"
        },
        {
            "id": "899",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /Señor Jesucristonejta \n Rikusun Diosninchejtay \n Yawarninwan mayllawanchej\n Tukuy juchanchejmanta."
        },
        {
            "id": "900",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /Aleluya, Aleluya. \n Kusikuna Jesuspi/"
        },
        {
            "id": "901",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " Señor Jesús Diosninchejman \n Qosun kawsayninchejta. \n Evangelio yachachiyman\n Kallpanchcjtapis qona."
        },
        {
            "id": "902",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /Aleluya, Aleluya. \n Kusikuna Jesuspi/"
        },
        {
            "id": "903",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " Todos juntos levantemos \n Gracias al buen Salvador; \n Siempre es grande su paciencia\n Y        eternal su dulce amor."
        },
        {
            "id": "904",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /Aleluya, aleluya, \n Proclamemos su loor./"
        },
        {
            "id": "905",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " El divino rey eterno \n Nos rodea con favor; \n Santifica a los creyentes\n Y        perdona al pecador."
        },
        {
            "id": "906",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /Aleluya, aleluya, \n Proclamemos su loor./"
        },
        {
            "id": "907",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " Que tengamos, pues, confianza, \n Fiel es nuestro Salvador; \n En el cielo reunidos\n Cantaremos su loor."
        },
        {
            "id": "908",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /Aleluya, aleluya, \n Proclamemos su loor./"
        }
    ]
}